# The map the SERVER game is on, read from its console: every level load logs
# "[SourceSharp/Server] level init: <map>", so the LAST such line names the
# current map (a rotation logs a newer one). host_map is NOT this question:
# the engine sets it only in Host_NewGame (the engine's `map`/new-game path),
